        "changed_source": [
          "The 0x60 inherited WindowBase layout replaces the old duplicate prefix. The status window retains the native constructor and PageIndicator pointer at 0x68. The page, scales, and total size match their layout assertions.",
          "The chart remains at vt4. The old get_record_slot helper was inline, and vt4 still maps the two base records to 0/1 or 2/3 according to page == 2.",
          "The title draw method belongs to TAdTitleTexGC and the layout entry is a native TUnk_804CF998 constructor with an s32 argument. The fork's status-member declarations would use a wrong owner and argument type.",
          "The deleted status member declarations map to the native checkbox, PageIndicator, keyboard base, info menu, icon row, scroll bar and shop owners. The status destructor keeps its native C++ form.",
          "The four render and allocation utilities retain their live declarations and original addresses. The fork exposes equivalent helper bodies under different labels or declarations. Current callers keep the established working interfaces."
        ],
